      "final_text": "美国市场：美国市场下跌（标普500 -0.2%，纳斯达克+0.7%），但市场广度表现积极，等权重标普500上涨+0.2%，并创历史新高。科技股及半导体股整体走弱。美国国债收益率上行（2年期+2个基点至4.17%，10年期+4个基点至4.48%，30年期+4个基点至4.97%）。美元指数上涨+0.2%，黄金上涨+1.1%，布伦特原油下跌-1.9%，收于约71美元。美联储主席沃什在一场会议上的讲话未提供太多增量信息，但他表示通胀压力已有所减弱。",
      "iterations": 0,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. markets: U.S. markets fell (S&P 500 -0.2%, Nasdaq +0.7%) though market breadth was positive as the equal-weight S&P 500 gained +0.2% and ended at a new all-time high. Tech and semis were largely weaker. Treasury yields moved higher (2Y +2bps to 4.17%, 10Y +4bps to 4.48%, 30Y +4bps to 4.97%). The dollar index gained +0.2%, gold rose +1.1%, Brent crude settled lower by -1.9% to ~$71. Fed Chair Warsh’s comments at a conference did not add much incremental information, though he said inflationary pressures have diminished.",
